{"t":"Tome of Knowledge","s":"tome-of-knowledge-91096","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Tome_of_Knowledge_2cf731.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tome of Knowledge</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Tome of Knowledge\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tome_of_Knowledge_2cf731.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Household Items<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Books\">Books</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,000 - 50,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.54<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091209215545&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tome_of_Knowledge_2cf731.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a Tome of Knowledge.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 15.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Bring this encrypted book to a sage in Farmine to gain wisdom or unlock more of Zao's culture.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>These books are valuable and sought after by certain players. A few of them are extremely hard to get hold of.<br/>\nObtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">Tomes of Knowledge Quest</a>. You need to hand these books in to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> by saying \"<span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Tome of Knowledge</span>\" to unlock trading abilities with <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> NPC's and earn other rewards. You can only give one Tome of Knowledge to him every 20 hours in real time.<br/>\nRewards for handing the tomes into NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>1st Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Tapestry\">Dragon Tapestry</a><br/> Allows you to buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Tapestry\">Dragon Tapestries</a> from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Pompan\">Pompan</a> for 80 gp each.</li>\n<li><b>2nd Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Backpack\">Minotaur Backpack</a><br/> Allows you to buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Backpack\">Minotaur Backpacks</a> from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Pompan\">Pompan</a> for 200 gp each and sell him lizard flags.</li>\n<li><b>3rd Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Weapon%20Rack\">Lizard Weapon Rack</a><br/> Allows you to buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Weapon%20Rack\">Lizard Weapon Rack</a> from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Esrik\">Esrik</a> for 500 gp each.</li>\n<li><b>4th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Rice%20Ball\">Rice Balls</a><br/> Allows you to trade a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> for 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Rice%20Ball\">Rice Balls</a> with NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Swolt\">Swolt</a>. This can be repeated as often as you like, as long as you have a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a> to give to <a href=\"#/wiki/Swolt\">Swolt</a>.</li>\n<li><b>5th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Backpack\">Dragon Backpack</a><br/> Allows you to buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Backpack\">Dragon Backpacks</a> from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Pompan\">Pompan</a> for 200 gp each.</li>\n<li><b>6th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Drum\">War Drum</a> &amp; <a href=\"#/wiki/Didgeridoo\">Didgeridoo</a><br/> Allows you to buy <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Drum\">War Drums</a> (for 1000 gp each) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Didgeridoo\">Didgeridoo</a> (for 5000 gp each) from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><b>You need to have finished <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a> in order to hand in the rest of the tomes</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>7th Tome</b>: Snake Head Teleport<br/> Handing in 7 Tomes you will allow you to use the snake teleport at the peak of the mountain, inside of which <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> is located. It takes you to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleporter</a> in northern <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>, south of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonblaze%20Peaks\">Dragonblaze Peaks</a> which is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleporter</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>. The snake head teleport is a one-way teleport <b>only</b>!</li>\n<li><b>8th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Corruption%20Hole\">Corruption Hole</a><br/> Allows you to  enter a hole in the north-eastern end of <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>, where you can find many <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Chosen\">Lizard Chosen</a> as well as 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragon</a>.</li>\n<li><b>9th Tome</b>: Lizard Weapons<br/> Allows you to sell <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Helmet\">Zaoan Helmet</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\">Zaoan Armor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Legs\">Zaoan Legs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drakinata\">Drakinata</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Traditional%20Sai\">Traditional Sais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Sword\">Zaoan Sword</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drachaku\">Drachaku</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Twin%20Hooks\">Twin Hooks</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Halberd\">Zaoan Halberd</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow%27s%20Necklace\">Wailing Widow's Necklace</a> to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Esrik\">Esrik</a>.</li>\n<li><b>10th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace\">Zao Palace</a><br/> Allows you to enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace\">Zao Palace</a>. It is situated deep underground, below the mountain base of the Lizards. You will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghastly%20Dragon\">Ghastly Dragons</a> there, but before you get to them you will have to fight your way through hordes of <a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Warmaster\">Draken Warmasters</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Spellweaver\">Spellweavers</a>.</li>\n<li><b>11th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Statue%20%28Item%29\">Dragon Statue</a><br/> Allows you to buy a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Statue%20%28Item%29\">Dragon Statue</a> from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> after you bring him a <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Lantern\">Red Lantern</a>.</li>\n<li><b>12th Tome</b>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Throne\">Dragon Throne</a><br/> NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> will now make a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Throne\">Dragon Throne</a> for you after you bring him a <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Red Piece of Cloth</a>. There is a time limit on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Throne\">Dragon Throne</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> will only make them once every 5 weeks (35 days) for you.</li>\n<li><b>More than 12 Tomes</b>: If, by any chance, you are able to get more than 12 Tomes, you can still hand them in to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a>. He will reward you with 5000 experience points for each extra tome you give to him, but still only one is allowed every 20 hours in real time.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Update 9.83, Tomes of Knowledge could only be turned in every 24 hours instead of 20.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/an-uneasy-alliance-quest\">An Uneasy Alliance Quest</a></li><li>Bone Shoulderplate</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Books\">Books</a></li><li>Broken Draken Mail</li><li>Broken Halberd</li><li>Broken Slicer</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Ripe%20Rice\">Bunch of Ripe Rice</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/children-of-the-revolution-quest\">Children of the Revolution Quest</a></li><li>Crystalline Arrow</li><li>Cursed Shoulder Spikes</li><l